menu "ESP Bytebeat Configuration"

    config ESP_BYTEBEAT_USE_DSP
        bool "Use ESP-DSP optimized math functions"
        default y
        help
            Enable hardware-accelerated math functions via ESP-DSP library.
            This provides 3-5x speedup for trigonometric operations (sin, cos, tan)
            and other math functions (sqrt, etc).
            
            Supported chips: ESP32, ESP32-S3, ESP32-P4
            
            If disabled, standard C math library will be used.

endmenu
